WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.817 --> 00:00:04.025
AgentPack: one install for MCP servers across Claude Code, Codex and OpenCode

2
00:00:04.025 --> 00:00:07.130
It finds every coding agent on the machine (demo sandbox: throwaway configs)

3
00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.739
Scan a project: it detects the stack, with the file that proves it

4
00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:14.917
Pick a pack: "Local Developer" needs no API keys

5
00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:18.736
Review the plan: every config file is backed up before it is touched

6
00:00:18.736 --> 00:00:23.258
Installing into all 3 agents, then launching each server to prove it responds…

7
00:00:23.258 --> 00:00:28.380
3 servers × 3 agents installed. 39 tools discovered. All verified.

8
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.387
And one click undoes the whole run.
